# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# Every path that does not match a built file is served index.html with a 200,
# so react-router resolves the route on the client. Without this a hard refresh
# on /projects/moss returns Cloudflare's own 404 rather than the page.
#
# The 200 matters: a 302 would send crawlers to / and cost the case study its
# own indexed URL. Genuine 404s are the router's job, not the host's.
/*  /index.html  200
